Package: longtermLinkage
Type: Package
Title: Long-Term Effect Estimation with Linked Trial and Follow-Up Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Gang", "Cheng", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "mathchenggang@gmail.com"),
    person("Ying-Qi", "Zhao", role = "aut"),
    person("Yen-Chi", "Chen", role = "ctb"),
    person("Joseph M.", "Unger", role = "ctb"),
    person("Cathee", "Till", role = "ctb")
  )
Description: Implements Cox-model estimators for long-term treatment effects
    when randomized clinical-trial records are partially linked to
    observational follow-up data. Methods include complete-case analysis,
    augmented complete-case analysis, non-linked-as-censored analysis, and
    inverse-probability-of-linkage weighting from Cheng et al. (2026)
    <doi:10.1080/01621459.2025.2526703>. Simulation generators and a synthetic
    Prostate Cancer Prevention Trial data example are included.
